WEBVTT

00:02.080 --> 00:05.630
Helck, Vermilio, and Piwi safely land on
the continent after crossing the ocean.

00:05.630 --> 00:08.040
They meet with some locals
from the ruined Kingdom of Erille,

00:08.040 --> 00:11.170
where the barbarians of the Tothman Tribe
impose a reign of terror.

00:11.830 --> 00:16.210
In order to help the suffering Erilleans,
Helck rises up to fight the Tothman King.

00:42.420 --> 00:44.670
Kurui dashita haguruma ga

00:44.670 --> 00:47.330
Kanakirigoe de sakendeiru

00:47.330 --> 00:49.330
Hibana o chirasu unmei

00:49.330 --> 00:52.170
Moeagaru suki o ukagau mitai

00:52.420 --> 00:54.500
Yabai card hikiateta

00:54.500 --> 00:57.130
Pinch no toki koso chance da

00:57.130 --> 00:59.040
Mada akiramete nanka nai

00:59.040 --> 01:01.920
Saigo made tatsu mono ga shousha da

01:02.130 --> 01:04.330
Hohoemi kakeru akuma

01:04.330 --> 01:07.080
To te o toriatte odorou

01:07.080 --> 01:09.330
Narifuri kamau koto wa nai

01:09.330 --> 01:11.670
Gekijou ni yuragu ketsui

01:11.670 --> 01:14.630
Yami ni nomarete shimau mae ni

01:14.830 --> 01:15.500
Break it

01:15.500 --> 01:17.000
Keriagero

01:17.000 --> 01:20.080
Kudakechiru no wa kimi no joushiki da

01:20.080 --> 01:24.580
Dare ni mo makenai honoo kokoro ni daite

01:24.880 --> 01:30.290
Ima hateshinai sekai ni sasageru kono inori ga

01:30.290 --> 01:35.040
Kanau asu ga kuru made taeru koto naku

01:35.040 --> 01:36.670
Moyashi tsuzukeru

01:36.670 --> 01:39.540
It's my soul

01:47.040 --> 01:51.960
<b>In Pursuit of a Map</b>

02:31.750 --> 02:32.710
That thing's a monster!

02:32.710 --> 02:34.080
Protect the Princess!

02:34.830 --> 02:35.960
He's out of control!

02:36.630 --> 02:38.130
You all need to get out of here!

02:38.130 --> 02:39.960
We'll figure out how to handle him!

02:39.960 --> 02:41.080
Ah, okay!

02:44.830 --> 02:47.330
Dammit. I've had enough of you.

02:48.830 --> 02:49.750
Cut it out!

02:57.380 --> 02:58.330
He regenerated?!

02:58.330 --> 03:01.170
Barbarians like him actually have that ability?!

03:01.420 --> 03:03.000
No, hold on.

03:03.000 --> 03:04.670
It's more likely that
he only became capable

03:04.670 --> 03:06.750
of regenerating after taking
on that monstrous form.

03:07.000 --> 03:09.250
Even his combat level has skyrocketed.

03:09.500 --> 03:10.750
What the hell is he?

03:21.880 --> 03:24.420
Just wait. I'll put you out of your misery.

03:30.710 --> 03:32.460
Such a tremendous amount of power...

03:32.960 --> 03:35.170
Despite the fact his hostility
isn't even aimed at me,

03:35.830 --> 03:38.880
it feels like I'll be killed the instant
that I let my guard down.

03:48.380 --> 03:50.250
He didn't use any magic!

03:50.250 --> 03:52.750
All that damage came purely
from the force of his punch!

04:02.040 --> 04:03.420
W-wait a second, Helck!

04:03.420 --> 04:05.250
It's over now! He's already done for!

04:13.630 --> 04:17.080
What a pleasant sensation...

04:17.080 --> 04:19.630
I've never felt anything like it...

04:20.670 --> 04:22.000
Pitiful fool.

04:22.380 --> 04:26.670
He exhausted all his remaining life energy
just for that momentary boost of power.

04:31.040 --> 04:35.170
It's nice... so nice...

04:40.630 --> 04:41.920
I don't get it.

04:41.920 --> 04:44.580
He was never actually strong enough
to pose a real threat to us.

04:45.330 --> 04:47.000
So why was I intimidated?

04:47.000 --> 04:51.210
The instant that he started to transform,
I felt a chill go down my spine.

04:51.830 --> 04:55.830
Is that dreadful transformation one of the
special abilities of their barbarian tribe?

04:56.500 --> 04:57.380
Or maybe...

04:57.790 --> 04:59.040
No.

04:59.040 --> 05:01.380
This is a clean land that's free of the toxin.

05:01.750 --> 05:05.080
So it's implausible for it to have any
relation to the powers of the barbarians.

05:05.750 --> 05:08.880
However, something feels off
about this whole thing.

05:09.210 --> 05:11.210
I'm still on edge about it.

05:16.210 --> 05:17.420
A barbarian...

05:18.040 --> 05:21.330
Ultimately, we're the ones responsible
for killing their king.

05:21.830 --> 05:23.790
I guess we can't settle this quietly.

05:24.210 --> 05:25.580
I'll handle them.

05:26.580 --> 05:27.750
Thank you.

05:28.130 --> 05:29.000
Huh?

05:29.880 --> 05:30.830
Thank you.

05:30.830 --> 05:31.710
Cheers.

05:31.710 --> 05:33.210
We really appreciate it.

05:36.130 --> 05:37.790
Let me get this straight.

05:37.790 --> 05:40.330
Were the barbarians simply
unable to defy their king?

05:44.210 --> 05:46.040
What is that light over there?!

05:46.040 --> 05:47.960
Something might have happened.

05:47.960 --> 05:49.130
Let's check it out.

05:53.420 --> 05:55.380
Piwi! What's wrong?!

05:55.960 --> 05:57.500
They're glowing!

05:57.500 --> 05:59.130
Yeah, I can see that!

05:59.130 --> 06:01.710
Whoa, my body... it's changing!

06:01.710 --> 06:03.500
Are we reverting?!

06:04.210 --> 06:06.000
Has the curse been broken?!

06:10.380 --> 06:11.630
We're back!

06:19.460 --> 06:22.380
The curse changed their appearance
pretty drastically, huh?

06:23.250 --> 06:24.330
Good for them.

06:28.880 --> 06:31.460
My dear travelers! Are you okay?

06:31.460 --> 06:32.420
It's the Princess!

06:32.420 --> 06:33.630
Your Highness!

06:34.040 --> 06:36.040
Oh, what a relief.

06:36.040 --> 06:37.960
I do hope you're not injured!

06:40.540 --> 06:42.380
Yep. We're just fine.

06:49.330 --> 06:52.920
As of now, the horrible reign of the
Tothman Tribe has come to an end,

06:52.920 --> 06:56.330
which means we can once again enjoy
the peace and freedom of our kingdom.

06:56.830 --> 07:02.670
Thank you, so, so very much for saving
the Kingdom of Erille and all its people!

07:02.670 --> 07:06.960
It was nothing!
Please raise your head, Princess.

07:06.960 --> 07:08.500
We don't need any thanks.

07:08.710 --> 07:10.380
These people were on the brink.

07:10.380 --> 07:13.580
Ready to face certain doom
after the fall of their kingdom.

07:13.880 --> 07:15.460
It's no wonder they'd be grateful.

07:15.880 --> 07:19.750
We shall pass down the tales of your
heroic deeds for many generations to come!

07:19.750 --> 07:23.080
So please!
You must share your names with us!

07:23.080 --> 07:25.420
Gosh. I don't know...

07:25.420 --> 07:26.790
They're Helck and Annie!

07:26.790 --> 07:28.290
Oh! How marvelous!

07:28.540 --> 07:29.630
Come, my subjects!

07:29.630 --> 07:32.500
Sing the praises of our saviors who
restored the of Kingdom of Erille!

07:32.500 --> 07:35.040
Praise Savior Helck! Praise Savior Helck!

07:35.040 --> 07:36.210
Praise Savior Annie! Praise Savior Annie!

07:36.210 --> 07:37.580
W-wait! I'm just Anne!
Praise Savior Annie! Praise Savior Annie!<b></b>

07:37.580 --> 07:38.380
W-wait! I'm just Anne!
Praise Savior Helck! Praise Savior Helck!<b></b>

07:38.380 --> 07:39.920
Don't remember me as "Annie"!
Praise Savior Helck! Praise Savior Helck!<b></b>

07:39.920 --> 07:40.880
Praise Savior Annie! Praise Savior Annie!

07:40.880 --> 07:42.380
Well, shucks.
Praise Savior Annie! Praise Savior Annie!<b></b>

08:00.790 --> 08:04.000
With that wrapped up,
our next step is to head west!

08:04.250 --> 08:06.790
There are two large kingdoms
located that direction,

08:06.790 --> 08:10.170
so chances are good that we can
find a map leading to the Empire there.

08:10.540 --> 08:11.580
Cheep!

08:11.580 --> 08:13.880
Wait. Where is Helck?

08:13.880 --> 08:15.670
Anne! Take a look!

08:17.000 --> 08:19.210
They're still waving goodbye
to us over there!

08:19.210 --> 08:20.460
PAY ATTENTION TO ME!

08:20.460 --> 08:24.540
Lord Helck! Lady Annie!
Please be safe on your journey!

08:24.540 --> 08:25.790
Bye!

08:26.040 --> 08:27.710
Please no more "Annie."

08:27.710 --> 08:31.130
I really hope the restoration
of their kingdom goes smoothly.

08:31.130 --> 08:32.080
Yeah.

08:39.380 --> 08:41.830
Please stop! Don't bite me!

08:41.830 --> 08:43.380
The next kingdom over was wiped out?!

08:43.630 --> 08:44.000
Get off! Don't lick me!

08:44.000 --> 08:46.250
Well, I'm just an outsider traveling through,
Get off! Don't lick me!<b></b>

08:46.250 --> 08:48.420
so I don't have all the details.

08:48.420 --> 08:50.040
But as I hear it,

08:50.040 --> 08:54.130
a really violent war broke out between the
two nearby kingdoms a long time ago.

08:54.420 --> 08:57.170
And it led to both sides going up... in smoke!

08:57.330 --> 09:00.830
What?! Are you saying that both
kingdoms were destroyed?!

09:01.040 --> 09:03.130
The war between them
really raged that hard?!

09:03.630 --> 09:05.130
How else do you explain it?

09:05.130 --> 09:07.540
I mean, it only took a few days
until they both went kablooey!

09:07.540 --> 09:08.500
Or so they say.

09:08.920 --> 09:11.000
You should visit that town over there.

09:11.000 --> 09:13.670
One of the residents might know
more about what happened.

09:24.000 --> 09:25.830
It's a town full of peddlers...

09:25.830 --> 09:26.710
Yeah.

09:27.000 --> 09:31.880
Augis, Augis

09:33.920 --> 09:40.960
The one and final hope, clad in darkness

09:40.960 --> 09:47.960
Laying waste to the world
and bringing us deliverance

09:48.790 --> 09:54.040
Augis, Augis

09:55.580 --> 10:01.920
It is for your sake that I now pray

10:02.920 --> 10:13.000
Please let the day come
when your soul may be at peace

10:13.290 --> 10:16.540
Peace...

10:17.830 --> 10:20.290
I wonder if that song is about
the two ruined kingdoms.

10:20.960 --> 10:23.250
Maybe that woman is one of the survivors.

10:23.250 --> 10:24.130
Anne!

10:25.710 --> 10:28.630
Look. Isn't that a map seller?

10:29.380 --> 10:32.040
Why yes, of course I have one.

10:32.040 --> 10:33.290
Are you serious?!

10:33.290 --> 10:36.330
I bought it off a traveler a long time ago.

10:36.330 --> 10:37.630
And you're sure it's legit?

10:37.630 --> 10:40.880
It's written here as
"The Great Empire of the Dwelling Dragon."

10:40.880 --> 10:43.170
That's it! Please let me take a look!

10:43.170 --> 10:44.580
A dragon lives there?!

10:44.580 --> 10:48.040
Hold your horses!
I can't just show it you for free!

10:48.460 --> 10:50.290
We'll buy it! How much do you want?

10:52.080 --> 10:53.710
50,000 lin!

10:53.710 --> 10:55.710
YOU WANT LIN?!

10:55.710 --> 10:57.130
Huh? That's the shocking part?!

10:58.170 --> 10:59.540
Now that I think about it,

10:59.540 --> 11:02.000
we don't have any of the currency
used in this region.

11:02.000 --> 11:02.960
That's right.

11:03.920 --> 11:05.710
Aw, hell! You damn window shoppers!

11:05.710 --> 11:06.630
Get lost!

11:06.790 --> 11:08.790
Hold on! We'll get your money!

11:08.790 --> 11:10.250
Just wait for a while.

11:10.250 --> 11:12.250
Don't you dare sell it to anyone!

11:12.250 --> 11:15.210
Uh-huh. I'll be waiting and expecting
a fat lot of nothing.

11:15.710 --> 11:17.830
Helck! Piwi! Time to go!

11:19.750 --> 11:22.040
What a rare sight. Customers of yours?

11:22.040 --> 11:24.170
Ah. Why hello, my dear.

11:25.040 --> 11:26.130
Hmm...

11:26.580 --> 11:31.080
Selling off all the crystals that we got from
Princess Erille only netted us 25,000 lin.

11:31.790 --> 11:33.880
Okay! Let's find a job!

11:34.130 --> 11:36.080
Some elbow grease will earn us the rest!

11:36.080 --> 11:37.830
It's not that simple.

11:37.830 --> 11:38.880
Take a look.

11:39.080 --> 11:41.920
The lunch over at that restaurant
only costs 80 lin.

11:42.330 --> 11:44.380
You've got a sharp eye, Anne!

11:44.380 --> 11:47.670
It's hard to say how many days of work
it would take us to earn the rest.

11:47.670 --> 11:50.130
We need something big
if we really want to rake it in.

11:50.460 --> 11:52.040
Something big, huh?

11:52.040 --> 11:54.250
Anyone is welcome to join
our cooking competition!

11:54.250 --> 11:56.960
The participation fee is a mere 1,000 lin!

11:57.960 --> 12:00.210
And can you believe it?
The grand prize winner will get...

12:00.210 --> 12:01.460
30,000 lin!

12:01.630 --> 12:02.920
30,000 lin?!

12:09.670 --> 12:10.920
That's our ticket, Helck!

12:10.920 --> 12:13.670
You can win a cooking competition
like that, easy!

12:15.040 --> 12:16.630
I'm not sure about that.

12:16.630 --> 12:20.420
Who knows if my style of cooking will
actually suit the palate of the locals?

12:20.420 --> 12:23.380
I would need to taste test some of
the popular dishes around here first.

12:25.330 --> 12:28.500
We don't have the luxury of time!
Just wing it and trust your gut!

12:28.500 --> 12:29.460
Step right up, folks!

12:29.460 --> 12:30.500
Sign-ups are ending soon!

12:30.500 --> 12:31.830
Wait a moment!
Sign-ups are ending soon!<b></b>

12:31.830 --> 12:32.960
We want to participate!

12:32.960 --> 12:35.080
Oh jeez, just look at those suckers.

12:35.080 --> 12:35.960
Pfft!

12:35.960 --> 12:38.500
This is a super high-level
cooking competition.

12:38.500 --> 12:40.080
They must be dumber than rocks!

12:41.040 --> 12:42.580
If nobody else is interested then th-

12:42.580 --> 12:43.880
Not so fast!

12:44.290 --> 12:46.330
I'm getting in on this action!

12:46.830 --> 12:47.920
W-whoa, it's him!

12:47.920 --> 12:51.880
The guy that's gone undefeated at a
bunch of street cooking contests: Ajikaba!

12:52.040 --> 12:54.330
You better count me in!

12:54.330 --> 12:56.790
I figured you would show up, Ajikaba.

12:56.790 --> 12:59.670
So that's "Ajikaba the Contest Sweeper," eh?

12:59.670 --> 13:02.750
Mamma mia!
That's what I call kicking things up'a notch!

13:02.750 --> 13:05.710
Th-this is nuts. Just look at that lineup!

13:05.920 --> 13:09.210
Moonmi the Mild Taste,
Touga the Spicy Sauce,

13:09.210 --> 13:12.040
and Ajikaba the Contest Sweeper!

13:12.040 --> 13:14.460
They're all expert chefs
who have claimed victory

13:14.460 --> 13:16.080
in a number of competitions!

13:16.080 --> 13:19.330
Not to mention, the head judge is a
serious heavyweight of the cooking world!

13:19.330 --> 13:21.040
Master Ryo Ridon!

13:21.040 --> 13:22.460
Ajikaba!

13:22.460 --> 13:27.000
You may be skilled, but I'll be the real judge
of just how far you've come as a chef.

13:27.790 --> 13:29.210
Bring it on!

13:29.210 --> 13:31.290
Everyone's getting heated up!

13:31.290 --> 13:34.000
Helck. I'm going to be on your side this time.

13:34.000 --> 13:35.000
Knock 'em dead.

13:35.000 --> 13:36.130
What do you mean, "this time"?

13:36.130 --> 13:38.580
Oh no! They all seem really tough!

13:39.210 --> 13:42.130
Okay! Our competitors
will have exactly one hour!

13:42.130 --> 13:44.000
The theme is: One-pot dishes!

13:44.000 --> 13:46.130
Without further ado... begin!

13:48.830 --> 13:49.790
Hey, punk!

13:49.790 --> 13:52.960
Prepare to get a taste of just
how hellish the cooking world can be!

13:58.080 --> 13:58.830
Check it out!

13:58.830 --> 14:02.750
Touga the Spicy Sauce is already pulling off
his fancy-ass tricks right from the get-go!

14:02.920 --> 14:04.540
Leave the odd jobs to me.

14:04.540 --> 14:05.750
Thanks.

14:07.420 --> 14:11.380
Moonmi the Mild Taste is gonna try and take
them all down with his specialty: a pizza!

14:11.580 --> 14:13.130
But that's not a one-pot dish!

14:13.130 --> 14:16.630
Ajikaba! You're nothing but a grape
that thinks he's wine!

14:16.630 --> 14:18.420
First you've gotta get'a crushed!

14:19.460 --> 14:21.000
This is unbelievable!

14:21.000 --> 14:25.330
These guys have a zest for cooking that's
way beyond anyone I've ever faced before!

14:29.130 --> 14:32.080
Hell yeah! Now we're talking!

14:32.080 --> 14:35.210
You're on! I'm gonna wipe
the floor with you guys!

14:35.210 --> 14:37.170
Huh? I can't get the fire going...

14:37.170 --> 14:38.750
Well, fire is my forte.

14:38.750 --> 14:42.080
All right! I know exactly what I'm gonna cook!

14:49.580 --> 14:52.460
Th-there it is! Ajikaba's famous dish!

14:52.460 --> 14:53.460
Ridiculous!

14:53.460 --> 14:56.000
The success rate of making
that dish is barely five percent!

14:56.000 --> 14:57.130
It takes incredible skill!

14:57.130 --> 14:59.710
Just'a one mistake and he'll be
at the bottom of the pot for sure!

15:00.000 --> 15:01.540
This is just overwhelming.

15:01.540 --> 15:04.250
These guys are so incredible
that I'm literally crying here.

15:04.250 --> 15:05.170
Yeah.

15:05.170 --> 15:08.710
I feel awful for those two nobodies who
decided to enter this crazy competition-

15:10.290 --> 15:11.710
They're frozen stiff!

15:11.710 --> 15:13.380
Nerves must be getting the better of them.

15:13.380 --> 15:14.330
Poor folks.

15:15.670 --> 15:17.460
No, wait. Look closer!

15:17.460 --> 15:19.500
He's moving so fast that it's a blur!

15:19.500 --> 15:21.250
You're right! Incredible!

15:21.670 --> 15:23.750
Hot damn! That's not all!

15:23.750 --> 15:26.460
Everything is going straight
into the pot after he cuts it!

15:26.460 --> 15:29.500
And on top of that...
the ingredients are laughing with joy!

15:29.670 --> 15:31.380
Holy crap!

15:31.540 --> 15:33.790
Alright! It's coming together.

15:33.790 --> 15:35.290
Anne. Give it a taste, would you?

15:38.920 --> 15:41.040
Why can't you just taste it yourself, dammit?

15:44.830 --> 15:49.540
DELISH!

15:50.040 --> 15:51.420
Sh-she really liked it...

15:51.420 --> 15:52.750
I guess it must be good!

15:52.750 --> 15:53.880
It's good! Really good!

15:53.880 --> 15:54.580
Wh-who knew there was chef of that
caliber hidden among the participants...
It's good! Really good!<b></b>

15:54.580 --> 15:56.880
Wh-who knew there was chef of that
caliber hidden among the participants...

15:56.880 --> 15:59.790
Just'a watching the guy work
tells me how delicious his food is.

15:59.790 --> 16:01.080
N-no way!

16:01.080 --> 16:04.710
His technique, sense, performance, looks...

16:04.710 --> 16:07.670
It's all in a way different league than me!

16:07.670 --> 16:08.710
Amazing...

16:11.380 --> 16:12.380
Simpletons.

16:12.380 --> 16:14.830
It seems you made a huge mistake
by underestimating Helck!

16:15.380 --> 16:17.080
Let me tell you about Helck's food!

16:17.080 --> 16:19.460
It was delicious enough to get him through

16:19.460 --> 16:22.210
the cooking round of the
New Demon Lord Competition with ease!

16:22.210 --> 16:24.420
What's the "Demon Lord Competition"?

16:24.420 --> 16:26.080
I dunno, but it sounds pretty incredible!

16:27.330 --> 16:31.000
Interesting. So this is what it feels like...

16:31.000 --> 16:33.420
to run against a brick wall!

16:33.420 --> 16:35.460
No sweat! I'll just climb over it!

16:35.460 --> 16:37.790
Because there's no wall too high for me!

16:40.500 --> 16:45.330
Augis, Augis

16:47.130 --> 16:54.580
The one and final hope, clad in darkness

16:54.580 --> 17:01.750
Laying waste to the world
and bringing us deliverance

17:02.420 --> 17:07.170
Augis, Augis

17:09.130 --> 17:15.540
It is for your sake that I now pray

17:16.380 --> 17:26.580
Please let the day come
when your soul may be at peace

17:26.790 --> 17:30.080
Peace...

17:32.040 --> 17:34.500
Hello there! What a pretty song!

17:34.500 --> 17:35.830
Hello there.

17:35.830 --> 17:37.750
You have a lovely singing voice yourself.

17:37.750 --> 17:39.330
Thanks!

17:39.500 --> 17:41.290
I've never seen your type around here.

17:41.290 --> 17:42.830
Are you by yourself?

17:42.830 --> 17:43.580
Yep!

17:43.580 --> 17:46.830
I went out looking for
popular food to help Helck!

17:46.830 --> 17:48.330
Then I got lost!

17:48.580 --> 17:49.960
Oh dear.

17:49.960 --> 17:51.670
Where are you trying to go?

17:51.670 --> 17:53.750
I can help you find your way, if you'd like.

17:53.750 --> 17:55.210
Thanks!

17:55.210 --> 17:56.880
Stop! Time is up!

17:57.130 --> 17:59.670
We will now move on
to tasting and judgement!

18:01.130 --> 18:02.420
It's perfect.

18:02.420 --> 18:07.500
My dish will definitely beat Ajikaba
and even that big musclehead!

18:07.500 --> 18:10.080
I gave it my'a very best performance!

18:10.080 --> 18:11.960
The winner is gonna be'a me!

18:13.670 --> 18:16.960
Look at them.
They all seem brimming with confidence.

18:17.210 --> 18:19.500
I'm guessing their dishes
must have turned out well.

18:19.790 --> 18:22.080
I mean, Helck is probably going to be fine,

18:22.080 --> 18:24.080
but I can't deny I'm a little worried.

18:24.290 --> 18:27.960
Thanks for your patience!
It's time to announce the results!

18:28.170 --> 18:30.710
Master Ryo, if you please!

18:30.960 --> 18:31.790
Very well.

18:32.080 --> 18:33.330
Chef Touga.

18:33.330 --> 18:35.080
Yours was too damn spicy,
you chowderhead!

18:35.080 --> 18:37.080
But it did taste good. 70 points!

18:38.460 --> 18:39.830
Chef Moonmi.

18:39.830 --> 18:41.960
The theme was one-pot dishes,
you chowderhead!

18:41.960 --> 18:43.880
But it did taste good. 70 points!

18:45.210 --> 18:46.710
Chef Ajikaba.

18:46.710 --> 18:48.880
You're too much of a greenhorn
to be cooking a dish like this!

18:48.880 --> 18:50.250
You stupid chowderhead!

18:50.250 --> 18:52.580
But it did taste good. 98 points!

18:54.040 --> 18:55.880
Chef Helck and Anne.

18:55.880 --> 18:58.290
Hmm, how do I put this?

18:58.290 --> 18:59.920
On the whole, you're chowderheads, but...

19:01.540 --> 19:04.330
He's struggling to comment on it?!
That doesn't bode well!

19:04.540 --> 19:05.790
Ultra delish!

19:05.790 --> 19:08.250
120 points! You win!

19:08.250 --> 19:11.210
And there you have it!
Chef Helck is the winner!

19:11.210 --> 19:12.330
Victory!

19:16.420 --> 19:18.080
I lost...

19:18.080 --> 19:20.130
I totally hit my limit...

19:20.130 --> 19:21.710
Everything's going white...

19:23.130 --> 19:24.420
I'm never going to cook agai-

19:24.420 --> 19:25.750
That was some fine cooking!

19:26.920 --> 19:28.380
You really impressed me!

19:28.670 --> 19:31.750
I hope that you'll give me the chance
to try your food again some time!

19:31.960 --> 19:33.290
You bet your butt I will!

19:33.290 --> 19:35.130
Come and get it, anytime!

19:35.130 --> 19:36.880
Cuz someday I'll surpass you!

19:36.880 --> 19:40.040
I'll whip up a dish
that's way out of this world!

19:40.420 --> 19:41.750
I look forward to it!

19:43.080 --> 19:44.750
That's a present for you!

19:45.000 --> 19:48.250
It's my recipe book that I consider
almost as important as my own life!

19:48.580 --> 19:51.830
I need to train,
so I'm gonna start over from scratch!

19:51.830 --> 19:52.920
Farewell!

19:52.920 --> 19:53.830
Bye!

19:56.540 --> 19:58.170
I knew it seemed oddly quiet around here.

19:58.170 --> 19:59.540
Piwi is missing.

19:59.540 --> 20:01.790
Piwi! Hey, Piwi!

20:01.790 --> 20:02.790
I'm back!

20:02.790 --> 20:03.750
Found him.

20:03.750 --> 20:06.630
I went and got the
most popular food around here!

20:06.630 --> 20:07.920
Now you can win for sure!

20:08.580 --> 20:10.750
Oh, you bought that to try and help us out?

20:10.750 --> 20:11.790
Yep!

20:12.000 --> 20:15.170
Well, I'm sorry.
The competition is already over.

20:15.170 --> 20:17.330
And... we won.

20:21.170 --> 20:23.250
Y-you guys are something else!

20:23.420 --> 20:26.580
How the heck did you manage
to get your hands on 50,000 lin

20:26.580 --> 20:28.210
in just a couple of hours?

20:28.210 --> 20:30.960
Forget that, just sell us the map.
We're in a hurry.

20:30.960 --> 20:32.210
Y-yes, ma'am!

20:32.750 --> 20:34.500
All right! That's definitely the place!

20:34.500 --> 20:36.210
The Empire sure is tiny!

20:35.040 --> 20:41.130
<b>The Empire</b>

20:36.210 --> 20:39.960
No, only a small corner of the Empire
is recorded on this map.

20:41.170 --> 20:42.290
P-pardon, ma'am!

20:42.290 --> 20:45.250
Does that mean
you're actually from the Empire?

20:45.250 --> 20:45.960
Yes.

20:45.960 --> 20:47.000
Not me!

20:47.000 --> 20:48.250
This is mind blowing.

20:48.250 --> 20:51.420
I never thought that the
Dragon Empire actually existed...

20:51.670 --> 20:54.250
It looks like we just need to head northwest.

20:54.670 --> 20:55.500
Right.

20:56.040 --> 20:58.460
First we'll need to get through
the remains of the two kingdoms,

20:58.460 --> 21:00.330
and then head for this desert town.

21:00.330 --> 21:03.080
Wait, ma'am!
Here's a piece of friendly advice.

21:03.080 --> 21:05.040
You should avoid the northwest, or rather,

21:05.040 --> 21:07.710
don't go into the abandoned territory
of the two kingdoms!

21:07.960 --> 21:09.170
Why is that?

21:09.920 --> 21:12.170
A warrior of darkness prowls around there.

21:13.040 --> 21:14.500
"Warrior of darkness"?

21:19.790 --> 21:22.580
Yakusoku suru yo

21:22.580 --> 21:25.540
Itsuka sekai ga

21:25.540 --> 21:27.630
Owaru toki mata

21:27.630 --> 21:30.250
Deaemasu you ni

21:42.330 --> 21:47.710
Hana no you na hito datta to

21:47.710 --> 21:53.630
Dareka ga chiisaku tsubuyaiteita

21:53.630 --> 21:59.170
Mizu no nai heya soredemo tashika ni

21:59.170 --> 22:01.670
Asu e saiteita

22:03.380 --> 22:06.170
Zenbu yume dattara

22:06.170 --> 22:09.040
Kimi o shiru koto mo

22:09.040 --> 22:11.960
Koi o suru koto mo

22:11.960 --> 22:15.460
Ikiru imi sae shirazu ni

22:16.290 --> 22:19.080
Tatoeba asu ga

22:19.080 --> 22:21.790
Donna ame demo

22:21.790 --> 22:24.170
Yoru wa ake sekai ni

22:24.170 --> 22:27.250
Niji ga kakaru you ni

22:27.630 --> 22:30.330
Mune no itami mo

22:30.330 --> 22:33.210
Tsutau namida mo

22:33.210 --> 22:36.670
Mirai e no tane ni kaete

22:36.670 --> 22:38.290
Ikiyou

22:39.000 --> 22:41.040
Bukiyou na ai ga

22:41.040 --> 22:44.210
Hana o sakasu made

22:46.000 --> 22:50.920
<b>Next Episode</b>

22:46.000 --> 22:50.920
<b>The Troubadour's Song</b>

22:46.710 --> 22:49.710
Next time: "The Troubadour's Song"
